+ * The order follows the 5.15 kernel, whose EL3 and APM firmware this
+ * kernel runs with: exynos_cpupm_idle_enter() (android_vh_cpu_idle_enter()
+ * in 5.15) configures PMUCAL to power down the core and enters the power
+ * modes before cpu_pm_enter(); exynos_cpupm_idle_exit()
+ * (android_vh_cpu_idle_exit()) leaves them and powers the core up in
+ * PMUCAL after cpu_pm_exit(). PSCI CPU_SUSPEND gets the plain power state
